{"title":"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 22","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(similar_to_other_solutions)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (similar to other solutions)</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the value of the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Expression\" title=\"Expression\">expression</a>\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/3/e63e3b9ec89bd66181c2082ca2c3f5d3837f4853.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{1}{\\log_2 100!} + \\frac{1}{\\log_3 100!} + \\frac{1}{\\log_4 100!} + \\cdots + \\frac{1}{\\log_{100} 100!}?\\]\" width=\"410\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/f/e5f82c1de9fe7628b6887825b4c63d21a98dc0d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ 0.01 \\qquad\\mathrm{(B)}\\ 0.1  \\qquad\\mathrm{(C)}\\ 1 \\qquad\\mathrm{(D)}\\ 2 \\qquad\\mathrm{(E)}\\ 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"388\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>By the change-of-base formula, \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/d/a7d308108bdf05a602b6a13f026286818a8ea2e5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log_{k} 100! = \\frac{\\log 100!}{\\log k}\\]\" width=\"151\" height=\"41\" />  \nThus (because if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/1/0110f1bb04c51b2a4d431bf14489fc1b48b37421.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"11\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/2/7222df8e8684aa73f1f1a30bd1c9b62013fd679e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{x}=\\frac{1}{y}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"50\" height=\"40\" />)\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/0/1800fe46a3d13afe1c569797b2b1d3cc3889b266.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{1}{\\log_k 100!} = \\frac{\\log k}{\\log 100!}\\]\" width=\"154\" height=\"41\" />\nThus the sum is \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/3/a43d0ab24fb8a354fa46dabb677507530839067c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\left(\\frac{1}{\\log 100!}\\right)(\\log 2 + \\log 3 + \\cdots + \\log 100) = \\frac{1}{\\log 100!} \\cdot \\log 100! = 1 \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{(C)}\\]\" width=\"534\" height=\"43\" />\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/7/5e712a9ad8a9d6370a51797d8791252b7bc0b160.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1=\\log_{k} k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"77\" height=\"17\" />,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/c/46cf706afa1d9d44629a51dc59bbc9945ee6840d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{1}{\\log_{k}100!}=\\frac{\\log_{k}k}{\\log_{k}100!}=\\log_{100!} k\\]\" width=\"249\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p>We add:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/f/5cfa5d82f6aedc41a17f9f60149ce86adcf21b83.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log_{100!} 1 +\\log_{100!} 2 +\\log_{100!} 3 +\\cdots + \\log_{100!} 100=\\log_{100!}100!=1 \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{(C)}\\]\" width=\"530\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\"Solution_3_.28similar_to_other_solutions.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(similar_to_other_solutions)\">Solution 3 (similar to other solutions)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (similar to other solutions)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/d/82dfa869b1ef0033f3517aa63f3d046beae7e79c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{\\log_a (b)} = \\log_b(a)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"137\" height=\"43\" />. So,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/2/6227c8467bf1f5c628945638fefeaa6d1e95e511.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{1}{\\log_2(100!)} + \\frac{1}{\\log_3(100!)}+ \\dots + \\frac{1}{\\log_{100}(100!)}\\]\" width=\"341\" height=\"41\" />\nis just\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/4/e241debcdbdfed80baa7d177a69edcc9c35a26ce.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log_{100!}(2) + \\log_{100!}(3) + \\dots + \\log_{100!}(100)\\]\" width=\"317\" height=\"18\" />\nwhich is\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/9/6395a19598cc42546d80c187368ec448bb75c780.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log_{100!}(2 \\cdot 3 \\cdot \\dots \\cdot 100) = \\log_{100!}(100!) = \\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 1}.\\]\" width=\"368\" height=\"28\" />\n</p><p>~Pinotation\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME\" title=\"1998 AHSME\">1998 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1998 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1998\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">Problem 21</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">Problem 23</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><spa